<section class="section soft">
  <div class="wrap split2">
    <div class="reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Our purpose</span><h2 style="margin-bottom:12px">Building excellence. Delivering fresh starts.</h2><p class="purpose-note">Zuwa Construction builds it. Zuwa Cleaning Services hands it over ready to use. Zuwa General Supply keeps both of them supplied.</p></div>
    <div class="reveal d1"><p class="purpose-kicker">Anyone can start a job. We&rsquo;re built to stand behind it.</p><p class="lead" style="max-width:none;margin:0">Zuwa Investments is building more than structures. We&rsquo;re building an institution: a company that will still answer your call ten years from now, honour every warranty, and hold the same standards on our hundredth project as on our first.</p><p class="lead" style="max-width:none;margin:14px 0 0">Whether we&rsquo;re constructing your building, cleaning it once the work is done, or supplying the materials that make it possible, our promise is the same. We do work that lasts, in a way that lasts.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

