      <div class="picker-panel"><div class="pp on" data-panel="construction"><p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:16px">New builds, renovations, refurbishment and property maintenance, run by a registered engineer.</p><ul><li>Site preparation, excavation and foundation works</li><li>Structural works including concrete, blockwork and roofing</li><li>Plumbing and electrical installations</li><li>Finishing: plastering, painting, tiling and fittings</li><li>Project management and quality assurance throughout</li></ul><div class="pp-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="book.html#construction">Book construction <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="construction.html">Read more</a></div></div><div class="pp" data-panel="cleaning"><p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:16px">We take a finished building from builders' dust to handover condition, and keep it that way.</p><ul><li>Dust, debris, stains and residue removed from floors, walls and ceilings</li><li>Windows, doors, bathrooms, fixtures and fittings cleaned</li><li>Specialist chemicals that do not damage new finishes</li><li>Final handover clean, ready for inspection or occupation</li><li>Commercial, residential and industrial properties</li></ul><div class="pp-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="book.html#cleaning">Book cleaning services <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="cleaning.html">Read more</a></div></div><div class="pp" data-panel="supply"><p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:16px">The materials that make a build possible, delivered when they were promised.</p><ul><li>Structural: cement, aggregates, blocks, reinforcement steel, roofing</li><li>Finishing: timber, boards, paints, tiles, sanitary ware</li><li>Services fittings: plumbing, electrical, HVAC consumables</li><li>Fixings, fasteners, hardware and site consumables</li><li>Standing accounts available for contractors on regular projects</li></ul><div class="pp-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="book.html#supply">Book general supply <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></a><a class="btn btn-line" href="supply.html">Read more</a></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
